      "created_at": "2024-07-24T16:05:11.888Z",
      "cooked": "<p>while selecting the item to manufacture, the system shows the Required items with quantity in child table as below.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/c/4cc2c13585f86f841539eab1b80b2d2b532adf92.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4cc2c13585f86f841539eab1b80b2d2b532adf92\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4cc2c13585f86f841539eab1b80b2d2b532adf92_2_690x203.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"aX3xXPIAkogPsORt6ggOC0cwpwK\" width=\"690\" height=\"203\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4cc2c13585f86f841539eab1b80b2d2b532adf92_2_690x203.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/c/4cc2c13585f86f841539eab1b80b2d2b532adf92.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/c/4cc2c13585f86f841539eab1b80b2d2b532adf92.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">748×221 13.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Required to edit the required_qty below :<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a6be32549c8809c49056403ffab0de7a2389f738.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a6be32549c8809c49056403ffab0de7a2389f738\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a6be32549c8809c49056403ffab0de7a2389f738.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nN4KM3MsIJ3rLezpfx8zdUH39vW\" width=\"690\" height=\"181\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">747×197 12.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>after saving, the system reset the qty to the previous, which we need to avoid, how can we do the same?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/3/237eed512b92942e6b8c508866ba3db205f9b374.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/237eed512b92942e6b8c508866ba3db205f9b374\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/3/237eed512b92942e6b8c508866ba3db205f9b374.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"540EnNio3wVj8lgAMyFFImaevt2\" width=\"690\" height=\"186\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">731×198 12.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
