      "created_at": "2025-08-08T14:02:29.020Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1st server script</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/7/b79731177a95d830d65478730cc53a23e72ab03e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b79731177a95d830d65478730cc53a23e72ab03e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/7/b79731177a95d830d65478730cc53a23e72ab03e_2_690x415.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qc7iQoG1VJlFVE8mdRKb2ae80Vg\" width=\"690\" height=\"415\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/7/b79731177a95d830d65478730cc53a23e72ab03e_2_690x415.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/7/b79731177a95d830d65478730cc53a23e72ab03e.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/7/b79731177a95d830d65478730cc53a23e72ab03e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">907×546 33.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">for row in doc.required_items:\n    row.original_required_qty = row.required_qty\n</code></pre>\n<p>2nd server script</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/5/05680371f055535115128f1eb2fdf55a1d71a928.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/05680371f055535115128f1eb2fdf55a1d71a928\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/5/05680371f055535115128f1eb2fdf55a1d71a928_2_690x481.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"LPezWrGDBpvPLxvzgxz7YeKStq\" width=\"690\" height=\"481\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/5/05680371f055535115128f1eb2fdf55a1d71a928_2_690x481.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/5/05680371f055535115128f1eb2fdf55a1d71a928.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/5/05680371f055535115128f1eb2fdf55a1d71a928.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">803×560 30.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">for row in doc.required_items:\n    if row.get('original_required_qty'):\n        row.required_qty = row.original_required_qty\n</code></pre>",
